<title>USA: U.S. Robotics redeems rights plan.</title>
<headline>U.S. Robotics redeems rights plan.</headline>
<dateline>SKOKIE, Ill. 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Robotics Corp said Thursday it redeemed its stockholder rights plan in connection with its merger with 3Com Corp, which shareholders of both companies approved on Thursday.</p>
<p>The redemption price for the existing rights will be paid to stockholders of record immediately before the merger is consummated, U.S. Robotics said. The redemption price for the existing rights will be $.001 per right and will be paid by check on or about June 18, 1997.</p>
<p>((-- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
